# The same bytes on every platform: the apps ship these files, the SBOM
# records their hashes and the page's CSP hashes the scripts. Without this,
# Git on Windows (core.autocrlf) checks text out with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
# cmd.exe needs CRLF in batch files
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Signatures cover exact bytes. Never rewrite line endings on checkout or add.
/data/advisories.json -text
/data/advisories.json.sig -text
